        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172498648?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">In \"Example 1: height and width\", in the for loop iterating over arrImages an undeclared variable \"i\" was being used, breaking the example.</p>\n\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">A declaration for the variable \"i\" has  been added just before it is used, as well as appropriate incrementation after each use in the loop.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">A broken example creates confusion.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41261",
            "title": "Declared missing variable i in Example 1.",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-24T05:23:16.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-23T20:19:42.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "GordonRamsay-689",
