        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF144 (and Safari) implement <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSStyleProperties</code>. This is a derived class of <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSStyleDeclaration</code> that represents the inline or computed styles on an element. It exists because  <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSStyleDeclaration</code> is now going to be a base class from which specific types of style and rule information will be applied, and only include the relevant information for that context.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Anyway, this adds the class. Note however that I have not yet updated the things that use it. I didn't think anything did, but in retrospect, Safari likely does.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41254",
            "title": "FF144 CSSStyleProperties docs",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-23T22:48:18.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-23T07:46:30.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF144 adds support for the JS Upsert Proposal in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1979917\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1979917</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note that covers the new methods added to <code class=\"notranslate\">Map</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">WeakMap</code>.,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3417399601\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41134\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41134/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41134\">#41134</a></p>",
